### 3. Delivery Status Callback Ingestion
#### [NEW] [`src/gateway/routes/status.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/routes/status.py)
- **Status Callback Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/channels/meta-whatsapp/status`: Ingests Meta delivery receipts (`sent`, `delivered`, `read`, `failed`).
  - `POST /api/v1/channels/twilio/status`: Ingests Twilio status webhooks (`MessageStatus`: `queued`, `sent`, `delivered`, `failed`, `undelivered`).
- Appends status transitions to `events/{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{message_id}_status.json` in Azure Blob Storage.
- Export router in [`src/gateway/routes/__init__.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/routes/__init__.py) and mount in [`src/app.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/app.py).

