### 5. Scheduled Reconciliation & Recovery Job
#### [NEW] [`src/worker/jobs/reconciliation.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/worker/jobs/reconciliation.py)
- **`ReconciliationJob`**:
  - Scans `inbox/` for orphaned work items older than 10 minutes without an active lease.
  - Attempts re-leasing and re-processing through `WorkerPipeline`.
  - Tracks retry attempts; if attempts exceed `max_retries` (3), moves the work item to `work/dead-letter/{message_id}.json` with error diagnostics and clears `inbox/`.

